  "flow_summary": "The interviewer successfully navigated a challenging, confused patient persona by consistently re-explaining questions and maintaining a structured approach. While the interviewer was patient and effective at redirection, the interaction was marred by repetitive, mechanical phrasing ('Before we move on, could you answer the question above?') and a tendency to re-ask questions that the patient had already addressed or that were not strictly necessary, leading to a somewhat rigid and robotic flow.",
